# P0-SRC — what the Vercel CLI may upload from console/. (.vercelignore
# REPLACES .gitignore for the CLI upload, so the gitignored secrets are
# excluded HERE too; node_modules and .next are always excluded — the build
# machine reinstalls dependencies from bun.lock.)
#
# The GENERATED mos-bundle/mos.mjs + mos-bundle/migrations are NOT excluded:
# they are gitignored (never committed — rebuilt deterministically by
# `bun run build:bundle` from the repository's own ../src), but a
# `vercel build` + `vercel deploy --prebuilt` CLI preview needs them on disk
# so the traced serverless functions ship the bundle (see README §7: a plain
# CLI deploy from console/ cannot run build:bundle remotely because the CLI
# uploads console/ only — ../src is not part of the upload).
.env
.env.*
.git
node_modules
.next
.vercel
scripts
*.log
